1
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:18,270
♪I stretch and yawn
when the sun is high in the sky♪

2
00:00:19,170 --> 00:00:23,030
♪A cup of tea and a little tune,
what a carefree life♪

3
00:00:23,890 --> 00:00:28,480
♪The fortune teller said
love would come my way this year♪

4
00:00:28,740 --> 00:00:32,580
♪But all I see is my food
arriving right on time♪

5
00:00:33,850 --> 00:00:35,670
♪No rush, no worries♪

6
00:00:35,670 --> 00:00:38,360
♪Love is all a matter of chance♪

7
00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:40,480
♪Flowers bloom and fade♪

8
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:43,380
♪I'd rather take good care
of myself first♪

9
00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:45,580
♪Two orioles sing among
the green willows♪

10
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:47,970
♪And I still don't have a boyfriend♪

11
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:50,590
♪My best years are nothing
to worry about♪

12
00:00:50,590 --> 00:00:53,240
♪I'll stay happily single
till I'm old and gray♪

13
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:07,540
=Besties' Coming Fortune=

14
00:01:07,580 --> 00:01:09,980
=Episode 15=

15
00:01:10,950 --> 00:01:11,950
Do you think it's noble

16
00:01:11,950 --> 00:01:13,360
to keep shielding me?

17
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:16,070
Do you think keeping everything

18
00:01:16,070 --> 00:01:17,640
from me is what's best for me?

19
00:01:23,560 --> 00:01:24,000
Cheng,

20
00:01:24,400 --> 00:01:25,560
isn't that exactly
what makes you so noble?

21
00:01:25,710 --> 00:01:27,070
From now on,
you can take my blood instead.

22
00:01:27,070 --> 00:01:27,920
I promise to stay fit and healthy.

23
00:01:27,920 --> 00:01:29,120
Take as much as you want.

24
00:01:29,230 --> 00:01:29,480
You...

25
00:01:29,480 --> 00:01:29,990
What are you doing?

26
00:01:29,990 --> 00:01:30,920
You're disgusting!

27
00:01:31,230 --> 00:01:31,590
Get off me!

28
00:01:31,760 --> 00:01:32,790
Cheng, you haven't promised me yet.

29
00:01:32,790 --> 00:01:33,150
Get off!

30
00:01:33,790 --> 00:01:34,310
Get off!

31
00:01:34,310 --> 00:01:35,040
I won't!

32
00:01:35,040 --> 00:01:35,840
Not unless you promise me.

33
00:01:35,840 --> 00:01:36,760
Come on!

34
00:01:37,200 --> 00:01:38,480
Get up first.

35
00:01:38,710 --> 00:01:39,560
No!

36
00:01:41,050 --> 00:01:42,450
- What's wrong?
- I said no!

37
00:01:44,870 --> 00:01:46,080
I'm shipping this.

38
00:01:47,070 --> 00:01:48,000
Get off me!

39
00:01:49,640 --> 00:01:51,320
- Will you just get off?
- Promise me!

40
00:01:56,120 --> 00:01:57,280
After working hard all night,

41
00:01:57,590 --> 00:01:59,030
I didn't manage to steal
any of the spotlight.

42
00:01:59,870 --> 00:02:00,870
It's infuriating.

43
00:02:04,140 --> 00:02:06,060
(Cheng)

44
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:07,950
Shen He is a lost cause.

45
00:02:09,080 --> 00:02:11,480
That fool only has eyes for Lin Shutiao.

46
00:02:12,560 --> 00:02:13,880
But that's fine.

47
00:02:14,520 --> 00:02:15,950
He was only my backup anyway.

48
00:02:17,360 --> 00:02:19,270
Heaven gave me a second chance at life.

49
00:02:19,630 --> 00:02:20,830
Doesn't that mean

50
00:02:21,960 --> 00:02:23,640
I'm the one destined for greatness?

51
00:02:30,240 --> 00:02:31,440
My priority now

52
00:02:32,310 --> 00:02:33,920
is to become
the Wife of the Marquis's Heir.

53
00:02:34,590 --> 00:02:36,270
As for those two women,

54
00:02:37,120 --> 00:02:38,790
once I've secured that position,

55
00:02:39,680 --> 00:02:41,950
I'll have plenty of time
to deal with them.

56
00:02:45,430 --> 00:02:48,040
Since appealing to his feelings
didn't work,

57
00:02:50,960 --> 00:02:53,480
I'll have to find a shortcut.

58
00:02:56,710 --> 00:02:57,200
Your Lordship.

59
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:58,190
As for the Third Prince,

60
00:02:58,190 --> 00:02:59,200
we found nothing suspicious.

61
00:02:59,560 --> 00:03:00,590
The only person connected

62
00:03:00,590 --> 00:03:01,320
to the incident at Qiyun Pass

63
00:03:01,560 --> 00:03:03,040
is his deputy general, Chang Qing.

64
00:03:03,280 --> 00:03:03,680
I heard

65
00:03:03,680 --> 00:03:04,790
he recently resigned and returned home.

66
00:03:10,680 --> 00:03:12,110
The Third Prince is about
to become Crown Prince.

67
00:03:12,680 --> 00:03:14,080
Now's the time for everyone
around him to rise in status.

68
00:03:14,870 --> 00:03:16,230
Why would he suddenly resign?

69
00:03:19,360 --> 00:03:19,710
You

70
00:03:20,470 --> 00:03:21,670
must bring him back yourself.

71
00:03:22,710 --> 00:03:23,920
Make sure he tells us everything.

72
00:03:24,470 --> 00:03:24,920
Yes.

73
00:04:03,400 --> 00:04:04,270
Your Lordship.

74
00:04:07,120 --> 00:04:08,230
Ever since we first met,

75
00:04:09,310 --> 00:04:11,760
I've given my heart to you.

76
00:04:14,400 --> 00:04:15,230
Tonight,

77
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:17,710
I'm willing to give myself to you

78
00:04:18,430 --> 00:04:20,510
if it means easing your burdens.

79
00:04:22,510 --> 00:04:24,560
You needn't feel indebted to me,

80
00:04:25,750 --> 00:04:26,560
because

81
00:04:28,630 --> 00:04:30,440
I'm the woman

82
00:04:30,680 --> 00:04:31,910
you're destined to be with.

83
00:04:39,720 --> 00:04:40,390
Your Lordship?

84
00:04:41,190 --> 00:04:42,000
Where are you?

85
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:47,680
Your Lordship?

86
00:04:50,190 --> 00:04:50,760
Nanny Rong.

87
00:04:51,430 --> 00:04:52,200
Why is it you?

88
00:04:52,310 --> 00:04:53,510
His Lordship said

89
00:04:54,240 --> 00:04:56,000
someone at the pavilion has a fever,

90
00:04:56,870 --> 00:04:59,350
so he sent me to treat her.

91
00:04:59,950 --> 00:05:02,510
As it happens, a few days ago,

92
00:05:02,630 --> 00:05:04,430
Third Madam taught me

93
00:05:04,430 --> 00:05:06,440
a couple of acupuncture techniques.

94
00:05:07,070 --> 00:05:08,800
Don't worry, Miss Song.

95
00:05:09,390 --> 00:05:10,710
I guarantee

96
00:05:10,950 --> 00:05:12,080
your fever

97
00:05:12,240 --> 00:05:13,680
will go down immediately.

98
00:06:14,920 --> 00:06:15,590
Shen Cheng.

99
00:06:19,750 --> 00:06:20,440
Shen Cheng.

100
00:06:23,190 --> 00:06:24,000
What's wrong?

101
00:06:24,560 --> 00:06:24,870
You...

102
00:06:24,870 --> 00:06:26,120
Why is your face so red?

103
00:06:27,390 --> 00:06:27,910
I'll go

104
00:06:28,480 --> 00:06:29,320
get a physician.

105
00:06:32,630 --> 00:06:33,800
Someone drugged me.

106
00:06:35,070 --> 00:06:35,680
I...

107
00:06:36,430 --> 00:06:37,030
I...

108
00:06:57,760 --> 00:07:01,110
♪Light hides within your eyes♪

109
00:07:01,680 --> 00:07:02,350
I'm sorry.

110
00:07:04,240 --> 00:07:05,350
I got carried away.

111
00:07:09,950 --> 00:07:11,390
You're under the influence of that drug.

112
00:07:12,070 --> 00:07:13,710
What good will kissing do?

113
00:07:16,100 --> 00:07:17,830
♪Our gazes cross♪

114
00:07:18,410 --> 00:07:21,820
♪An unnamed passion begins to burn♪

115
00:07:23,860 --> 00:07:27,170
♪Trapped with nowhere to retreat♪

116
00:07:27,170 --> 00:07:30,510
♪Yet I move a little closer to you♪

117
00:07:30,510 --> 00:07:36,920
♪Even the air catches fire
in this moment♪

118
00:07:37,020 --> 00:07:40,460
♪Our hearts beat faster
with every passing second♪

119
00:07:40,680 --> 00:07:44,110
♪Breaking down every defense♪

120
00:07:44,320 --> 00:07:47,690
♪Our eyes meet without a word♪

121
00:07:47,840 --> 00:07:51,830
♪Like an act of redemption♪

122
00:07:52,360 --> 00:07:53,040
I, Shen Cheng,

123
00:07:53,040 --> 00:07:53,560
will never

124
00:07:55,390 --> 00:07:56,350
let you down for as long as I live.

125
00:07:57,510 --> 00:07:58,640
Are you ready?

126
00:07:58,920 --> 00:07:59,910
♪In this tender uncertainty♪

127
00:07:59,960 --> 00:08:00,830
I'm going to start.

128
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:06,430
♪I'd gladly fall into the♪

129
00:08:06,440 --> 00:08:10,240
♪Depths of your eyes♪

130
00:08:16,830 --> 00:08:17,320
How do you feel?

131
00:08:18,040 --> 00:08:18,830
Much better, right?

132
00:08:20,070 --> 00:08:21,350
It's fine.

133
00:08:21,680 --> 00:08:22,880
No need to thank me.

134
00:08:23,430 --> 00:08:24,310
If you want to thank someone,

135
00:08:24,310 --> 00:08:25,200
thank Shutiao.

136
00:08:25,560 --> 00:08:27,120
She's the one who taught me this method.

137
00:08:30,240 --> 00:08:30,560
Hey.

138
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:31,830
By the way,

139
00:08:33,030 --> 00:08:33,790
do you know who

140
00:08:33,790 --> 00:08:34,870
drugged you?

141
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:43,720
We've finished investigating.

142
00:08:44,200 --> 00:08:45,810
Not only was aphrodisiac incense
burned in the pavilion,

143
00:08:46,200 --> 00:08:47,900
but the pastries, teapot, and flowerpots,

144
00:08:47,900 --> 00:08:49,710
even the corridor pillars and walls,
were covered in aphrodisiac powder.

145
00:08:50,340 --> 00:08:51,620
Anyone who knows would say
it's an aphrodisiac.

146
00:08:51,620 --> 00:08:53,350
Otherwise, they'd think
someone was trying to kill pests.

147
00:08:55,630 --> 00:08:56,350
Cheng, are you hurt?

148
00:08:59,750 --> 00:09:00,950
Just worry about yourself.

149
00:09:01,750 --> 00:09:02,630
And that wife of yours.

150
00:09:03,030 --> 00:09:03,840
Tell her to stop teaching my wife

151
00:09:03,840 --> 00:09:04,950
all that nonsense.

152
00:09:06,080 --> 00:09:07,110
What's Shutiao got to do with this?

153
00:09:10,790 --> 00:09:11,080
Cheng,

154
00:09:11,670 --> 00:09:12,230
I'll get going.

155
00:09:12,720 --> 00:09:12,990
Okay.

156
00:09:20,600 --> 00:09:21,350
Last night,

157
00:09:21,600 --> 00:09:22,710
I went to the wrong place

158
00:09:23,480 --> 00:09:24,920
and unintentionally offended you.

159
00:09:25,720 --> 00:09:27,040
Please forgive me, Your Lordship.

160
00:09:27,240 --> 00:09:28,470
You know perfectly well

161
00:09:29,150 --> 00:09:30,280
whether it was intentional.

162
00:09:31,750 --> 00:09:32,520
But now,

163
00:09:32,750 --> 00:09:33,470
none of that matters.

164
00:09:34,870 --> 00:09:35,830
I've found you a house

165
00:09:36,270 --> 00:09:37,280
on the outskirts of the capital.

166
00:09:37,840 --> 00:09:38,800
Move there immediately.

167
00:09:41,270 --> 00:09:41,800
Why?

168
00:09:42,360 --> 00:09:43,350
We're both your saviors.

169
00:09:43,600 --> 00:09:45,080
You never treated her this way before.

170
00:09:49,440 --> 00:09:49,920
Her?

171
00:09:50,670 --> 00:09:52,080
Miss Song, who exactly

172
00:09:52,670 --> 00:09:53,560
are you referring to?

173
00:09:54,670 --> 00:09:55,870
I meant to say

174
00:09:56,600 --> 00:09:58,470
you've always been fair and just

175
00:09:58,900 --> 00:09:59,850
and repaid kindness with gratitude.

176
00:10:00,240 --> 00:10:00,950
Why, then,

177
00:10:01,910 --> 00:10:03,320
are you so distant toward me alone?

178
00:10:03,320 --> 00:10:04,230
For saving my life,

179
00:10:04,840 --> 00:10:06,080
I will certainly repay you.

180
00:10:06,320 --> 00:10:08,160
Gold, silver, jewels,
jade, or precious stones,

181
00:10:08,670 --> 00:10:09,400
whatever you want,

182
00:10:09,790 --> 00:10:10,830
I'll give you all of it.

183
00:10:12,030 --> 00:10:13,440
But if you use that debt of gratitude

184
00:10:14,080 --> 00:10:15,470
as an excuse to hurt others,

185
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:17,160
I won't tolerate it.

186
00:10:23,200 --> 00:10:24,560
So that's how it is, Shen Cheng.

187
00:10:26,390 --> 00:10:27,320
Since your family

188
00:10:27,320 --> 00:10:28,680
won't help me get ahead,

189
00:10:29,910 --> 00:10:32,470
I'll find another way to rise to power.

190
00:10:36,090 --> 00:10:38,410
♪No matter how
the universe changes tomorrow♪

191
00:10:38,410 --> 00:10:45,610
♪Right now,
I just want to stay by your side♪

192
00:10:45,610 --> 00:10:50,810
♪Let this kiss and this dream
last until we're old♪

193
00:10:52,010 --> 00:10:57,050
♪And hold on to all
the tenderness of this moment♪

194
00:10:58,410 --> 00:11:03,490
♪Following this heartbeat,
we'll retrace our steps♪

195
00:11:04,850 --> 00:11:09,970
♪As time goes by,
all I need is your gaze♪

196
00:11:11,250 --> 00:11:14,610
♪One dream until our hair turns gray♪

197
00:11:33,370 --> 00:11:36,730
♪One dream until our hair turns gray♪
